From: Curium <curium@appautomaton.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add Curium headless shell bridge, extension V2 selectors, and prune unused BrowserKit appexes

Implements CrIOSEngineBootstrap and CrIOSBrowserHostV1/CrIOSTabHostingV1/CrIOSDownloadTaskV1
under //ios/chrome/browser/curium, intercepts SceneController when a shell bootstrap delegate
is registered, exports CrIOSEngineBootstrap and CrIOSExtensionManagerV1 with default visibility,
completes CrIOSExtensionManagingV1 V2 selectors (action presentation, observer, DNR counts,
popup host, commands), and prunes the three unused multi-process BrowserKit .appex targets.

